// Chapter 3: Cyclic Entanglements in Joe's Social Circle
Meet a Person:
    It has name, friend.
    To introduce with greeting:
        Joe yells greeting + ", I am " + jthis.name.
    That's how Joe does it.
That's a Person.

Joe remembers alice as a new Person("Alice", nothing).
Joe remembers bob as a new Person("Bob", alice).

// Create circular reference: Alice <-> Bob
alice.friend turns into bob.

alice.introduce("Hey there").
bob.introduce("Greetings").

If Joe believes alice.friend.name == "Bob":
    Joe yells "Joe confirms Alice and Bob have formed a codependent cycle!".
That is that.

Joe yells "Dumpster GC tracks and cleans up this cycle seamlessly.".
